<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 135 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 135 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction December 17 versus December 10  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    85/92	361/337</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.02/3.03   3.38/3.34</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.03/3.03   3.38/3.34</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.02/3.02   3.38/3.33</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million   85/240	50/165</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million     85/260	70/165</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 37,877 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
